  <ferc:DisclosureOfRateTreatmentWhereUnamortizedLossOnReacquiredDebtAndUnamortizedGainOnReacquiredDebtAccountsAreNotUsedTextBlock id="f-118" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;3. &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;OPERATING REVENUES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The Company's revenues are received in accordance with the Southwest Power Pool Inc (SPP) Tariff which includes the Company's formula rate as approved by the FERC. The Company is required to file its annual true-up of the prior calendar year by May 31st and the projected net revenue requirement for the current calendar year by September 30th.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfRateTreatmentWhereUnamortizedLossOnReacquiredDebtAndUnamortizedGainOnReacquiredDebtAccountsAreNotUsedTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfRetainedEarningsRestrictionsTextBlock id="f-119" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;4. &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;LONG - TERM BORROWINGS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The Company has a long term loan with NEECH which allows the Company to continue to borrow to keep its capital structure of 60% equity and 40% debt balanced as its capital requirements arise.&#160;The long-term loan was renewed in December 2025 and is due in November 2030.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Long-term debt consists of the following as of September 30: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:83.482%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:75.905%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.513%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:20.290%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.692%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="display:none"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:cente